{
  "_": "Fitzone H01 «Ажлын дараах стресс». Edit this file, then run npm run build:fitzone-h01 (writes cues.json + stems). 'from' is seconds in the original video (Huberman clips) or in the generated clip (b-roll). A beat lasts lead + pre + voice + post (or 'hold'); its cuts share that time in proportion to 'len'. 'audio' plays one continuous stretch of interview sound under the whole beat (full = at level, under = ducked once the Mongolian voice starts, bed = low throughout), whatever the picture cuts to. 'fx' on a cut: narrow = the edges close in like tunnel vision, widen = they open out. Shot kinds: med = Huberman's medium shot, close = his close-up, cover = a vertical clip filling the panel.",
